OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FResidual
OL,6,Fcloud lingering this evening, with the
OL,7,Fodd spot of rain into the early hours
OL,8,Fof Thursday. The odd clear spell
OL,9,Fdeveloping, mainly across the north of
OL,10,Fthe region. A cooler night under
OL,11,Feasing winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FA dry start for most,
OL,14,Falthough isolated showers possible,
OL,15,Fheavy at times. Turning drier with
OL,16,Fsunny spells developing through the
OL,17,Fafternoon. Feeling pleasant in any
OL,18,Fsunshine with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
