OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FHeavy
OL,6,Frain on Friday with coastal gales
OL,7,Fassociated with Storm Austen later.
OL,8,FDry for a time overnight before
OL,9,Fturning very wet and windy again
OL,10,FSaturday. Drier but breezy on Sunday.
